{"text": "I am so excited. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Be careful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Some of the dinosaurs are hungry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just stay calm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not want you to do anything foolish. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not worry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am not a fool. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They all began to walk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After some time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Travis whispered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is a T, rex. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One hundred meters away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A T, rex slowly appeared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It, whispered Eckels It Sh. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is huge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have never seen such a huge thing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am so scared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sh, quiet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Travis said angrily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You do not want it to see you.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "s", "o", " ", "e", "x", "c", "i", "t", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i", "d", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "e", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", "m", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "n", "o", "s", "a", "u", "r", "s", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "g", "r", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i